;; check, before chaining to find-parent-method's own base-menu-state-52
;; :code - the same find-parent-method-plus-raw-field-read idiom dropdown-
;; item's own :trans above already uses for its own state-52 :trans chain
;; (this file's own header doctrine, "Settles this rung's own plan-
;; unverified item 2" note), here reading offset 16 (:code) rather than 20
;; (:trans) off the returned state.
