;;     not re-derive the indexed field access once raw pointer math was
;;     mixed into the same expression, so it emitted the placeholder marker
;;     (same non-compiling class already resolved by hand at this tree's
;;     own default-menu.gc:1276-1283). Resolved to (-> this strings data
;;     s5-0 text), the plain indexed-array-of-struct read the raw math was
;;     already computing.
