;; menu2-installs.gc:994-996 and this file's own jakx-logo-menu re-install
;; above (Section E's own vtable-snapshot hazard: menu2-h.o's deftype forms
;; run before this file's own base-menu-method-60 (string-menu) exists, so
;; any subtype that never overrides it itself keeps the stale copy it
;; snapshotted at deftype time). dropdown-item is string-menu's own child on
;; this rung's live -boot road (the six lobby rows, plan section A) and
